<title>USA: Negotiated muni sales total $421 mln Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Negotiated muni sales total $421 mln Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scheduled negotiated municipal bond sales are expected to total $421 million million in 16 offerings Wednesday, according to Reuters Municipal Bond Information Group.</p>
<p>The largest issue is a $175 million Ohio taxable issue through Seasongood &amp; Mayer.</p>
<p>An additional five negotiated deals totaling $50 million are on Reuter's possible list for Wednesday, meaning underwriters have said they may price the issues depending on market conditions.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Information Group, 212-859-1826</p>
</text>
